('DEV-01','Mandatory Lab evidence for AI development','AI-affecting development SHALL use the selected local Lab and retain ai-development-run evidence before claiming observed AI completion; ordinary runtime SHALL remain usable without Lab. Specification-only and zero-call deterministic work SHALL keep their actual proof limits.', 'Recorded AI increment','A mapping prompt/adapter increment with selected positive/negative cases','the increment executes through Lab-linked native owners and saves exact evidence','Ordinary use or unavailable development evidence','Lab is off or the selected development observations are missing','ordinary learner grades remain usable and AI development is explicitly incomplete rather than reported verified','Selected dependency diff and actual experiment/observation receipts, not merely an enabled flag.'),
('DEV-02','Complete inference surface inventory','Development SHALL reconcile every owned remote/local inference and wrapper/helper/plugin path against ai-surface-inventory, including all fourteen declared surfaces and future additions. Static inventory SHALL not masquerade as runtime coverage.', 'Registered alternate inference route','An implemented speech/judge/alternate adapter path','the inventory identifies its owner/serializer/trusted fragments and separate actual calls','Unregistered helper or dynamic call','A hidden helper SDK call or local model path absent from inventory','dispatch reconciliation exposes it and the selected development coverage remains incomplete','Independent transport/local inference observer versus registered actual owner inventory.'),
('DEV-03','Versioned trusted instruction sources','Every trusted stage/schema/repair/fallback/judge/reference/adapter instruction fragment SHALL have an exact saved owner/hash. Dynamic answers/source/errors SHALL remain data, without hidden unversioned concatenation or recursive instruction expansion.', 'Inspect all rendered trusted fragments','A request includes a schema description and semantic-repair wrapper','their actual text/role/order and source hashes are reconstructable','Hidden instruction addition','An adapter appends an unregistered instruction or evaluates answer text as a template','the mismatch is observed and no complete controlled-context claim is issued','Actual serialized request bytes compared to independently listed trusted fragment sources.'),
('DEV-04','Exact model-visible snapshots','Each actual model call SHALL save the final noncredential request after all serialization/defaults and before dispatch, with actual part/asset hashes, modalities and framing. Non-LLM speech/ASR inputs SHALL be inspectable too.', 'Inspect speech and LLM actual inputs','A JSON LLM call and SSML/audio reference call','actual model-visible bytes/parameters match their saved snapshots','Post-snapshot SDK change','A serializer or SDK alters a default/role/prompt after snapshot creation','transport mismatch is retained as incomplete snapshot coverage instead of relying on template hashes','Independent actual transport/local argument capture versus snapshot-byte hashes.'),
('DEV-05','All attempt outcomes and caches accounted','Every initial/retry/fallback/repair/local/judge attempt SHALL retain distinct actual snapshots/receipts/spans, including failures/cancellation/late outputs. Cache views SHALL reference the original call without inventing a new dispatch.', 'Repair lineage and cache inspection','An initial call is repaired and later inspected from cache','two real attempts and one cache reference retain distinct lineage and real usage','Lost refused or interrupted attempt','An attempt refuses/errors/crashes after dispatch or an exporter drops it','the initiated attempt stays in the denominator and unresolved outcome/export stays explicit','Observed dispatch identities and lineage, not successful-row counts.'),
('DEV-06','Context disclosure and budget fidelity','Development SHALL exercise actual stage disclosure/budget selection: blind extraction omits keys/prior scores; independent audit omits mapper results; mapping/feedback retain required frozen inputs; ASR/reference conditioning remains explicit.', 'Correct stage-specific context','A fixed answer/key and actual native result enter the selected pipeline','each stage sees exactly its allowed required components and explicit optional selections','Leaked or truncated context','A custom policy adds the key to blind extraction, first-map decisions to audit or removes required answer bytes','the actual assembled context exposes the defect and no accurate-grade/independence claim is made','Final per-stage input asset versus independent allowed/required-input expectations.'),
('DEV-07','Variant binding and cache isolation','Prompt/context/fragment/schema/recipe/model/voice/input parameter changes SHALL affect the relevant frozen binding/cache identity. Editing/activation SHALL preserve earlier saved attempts and use the actual selected version, without hidden fallback.', 'Changed variant executes its own binding','A selected trusted fragment or model-visible parameter differs from baseline','new calls use that exact variant and old answers/results retain their original binding','Stale cache or alias substitution','A mutable alias changes or a cache entry has another effective input identity','the run does not reuse the mismatched decision or silently substitute a profile','Frozen full binding/input dependency hashes plus actual dispatched model/parameters.'),
('DEV-08','Measured semantic change evidence','AI development SHALL select affected positive/negative cases and actual dependent pipelines with frozen independent expectations, preserving failed/unperformed rows, all122coverage reporting and existing exact arithmetic. Unsupported quality improvement claims SHALL remain unproven.', 'Paired change with real failure counts','A baseline/candidate comparison on the same fixed reference population','paired metrics retain actual origins/denominators and relevant dependent cases','Optimistic or circular evaluation','Candidate-made labels, leaked expected answers, excluded failures or unselected leaves','the report labels self-consistency/missing coverage and cannot claim independent improvement/full coverage','Frozen reference assets and native formula sufficient statistics independent of the candidate.'),
('DEV-09','Observable and challenged judges','Judges/scorers SHALL use frozen rubric/prompt/profile/schema identities and actual trace/receipts, with correct/incorrect/unknown test packets. Judge agreement SHALL not replace native arithmetic or absent acoustic evidence.', 'Judge verdicts have actual provenance','Known correct/incorrect/unsupported packets and a selected diagnostic judge','saved verdicts/receipts expose false support/rejection/unknown handling with actual basis','Self-validating or invented judge evidence','The candidate grades its own labels or text-only judge claims observed phones','the circular/unsupported inference is retained and cannot establish independent/measured correctness','Withheld authored packet expectations, exact native arithmetic and actual modality evidence.'),
('DEV-10','Private but inspectable diagnostic artifacts','Development SHALL explicitly select permitted body capture and preserve private original/sanitized hashes and redaction reasons. It SHALL never export credentials/private source fields or claim complete body inspection after an undisclosed omission.', 'Sanitized context stays attributable','Permitted context plus controlled secret/private-field canaries','Lab copies omit those fields while original grading bytes and separate hashes stay correct','Forbidden or missing body copy','Source terms prohibit copying a component or redaction/export loses required content','inspection limits remain explicit instead of fake full capture or an exported secret','Actual canary bytes/assets versus allowed export projection and unchanged original input hash.'),
